Subject: [PATCH v7 10/26] dt: psci: Update DT bindings to support hierarchical PSCI states
Date: Thu, 12 Apr 2018 13:14:15 +0200
Message-Id: <1523531671-27491-11-git-send-email-ulf.hansson@linaro.org>
